                "Zeolite-Knap regenerator R8 is already afterburning. Dense-bed pyrometry prints "
                "745 C, 25 K over the 720 C afterburn stop. Torch oil is 1.80 tonnes per hour. "
                "Flue zirconia sits at 1.8 percent oxygen, which a reducing-look plaque treats "
                "as starved. Pyrometry-first should kill torch now; a weak supervisor files a "
                "12-second ramp instead and leaves the catalyst bed over temperature for the "
                "entire delay.",